Extinction is a thriller, adventure film directed by Adam Spinks.

3
00:14:17,142 --> 00:14:23,142
Deep in the Amazon jungle a group of scientists are on a dangerous mission.

4
00:19:02,857 --> 00:19:08,857
When their guide suddenly abandons them, they find
themselves in a savage and hostile environment.

5
00:23:48,571 --> 00:23:54,571
However, things turn deadly when they find they are in the middle of a hunting
ground for a pack of prehistoric predators long thought extinct.

6
